00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:37.060
I'm no, I'm saying I can't support him.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:38.060
I won't vote.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:44.550
I can't support either one of them, not Biden
or Trump, because they're not competent and

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:48.340
