and what we see on TV.

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:53.880
And Donald Trump because I don't believe he
can win.

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:54.880
Lawrence.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:59.050
You know, when you're under this much criminal
scrutiny and the conduct, by the way, that

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:03.980
